# Expo
.expo/
dist/
dist-*/
web-build/
# expo-env.d.ts is committed on purpose: it carries the `expo/types` reference
# that types `process.env`, so `tsc` (and CI) works on a fresh checkout without
# first running a dev server. Expo regenerates it with identical content.

